        "date": "2026-11-20T08:39:20Z"
      },
      "message": "docs(examples): add the catalog case 2d/slots\n\nOne 100 x 60 x 12 mm block with two closed slots of 10 mm width. A Slot\ncuts one slot in rows at two levels. A Trochoidal slot cuts the other\nslot in loops at the full depth. The README compares the two programs.\n\nThe Slot leaves up to 0.86 mm in its round ends with an ok verify.\n#2906 is the bug for it, and the README names it.\n\nPinned by slots_case_posts_a_slot_and_a_trochoidal_slot_to_the_same_floor\nand the two catalog tests that read each case.\n\nFixes #2861\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
