      "message": "refactor(test): move the 2d/slots catalog tests into a sibling file\n\nexample_catalog.rs grew to 471 lines, past the 400-line limit. The\n2d/slots case module, its PostedOp helper and its program pin move to\nexample_catalog/case_2d_slots.rs. The parent pulls the file in with\ninclude!, so each test keeps its full name: catalog_2d_slots::regenerates,\ncatalog_2d_slots::rebuilds and\nslots_case_posts_a_slot_and_a_trochoidal_slot_to_the_same_floor. The case\ncontract test lists the first two names. The #[test] count stays 29.\n\nRefs #2861\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
